---
import {Image} from "astro:assets";
import HomePageLink from "./HomePageLink.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/headshot.jpg";
import {site} from "@/lib/site";
---

<section
  class="mb-10 grid gap-6 md:mb-20 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:items-center md:gap-10 lg:gap-12"
>
  <div class="hero-fade-up">
    <!-- On phones, a small round avatar sits beside the greeting; the tagline runs full width below. -->
    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 md:mb-4">
      <Image
        src={headshot}
        alt=""
        class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover object-[center_25%] shadow-soft md:hidden"
        width={128}
        height={192}
        loading="eager"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
      <h1 class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-1 mb-0">Hi, I'm Becca.</h1>
    </div>
    <p
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-2 editorial-prose mb-4 font-sans text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-text sm:text-lg md:text-xl"
    >
      {site.tagline}
    </p>

    <p
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted"
    >
      After about ten years in the tech industry, I've become increasingly
      interested in the people and cultures that form around the things we
      make. Lately I've been researching what
      <a href="/making-things/closing-window">twenty years of Ravelry</a> can
      tell us about the changing economics of independent knitting design, and
      what the language on <a href="/making-things/language-of-work"
        >tech company careers pages</a
      > reveals about the industry and the people who run it.
    </p>
    <div
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-5 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-x-6 gap-y-3"
    >
      <HomePageLink href="/about">About my work</HomePageLink>
      <HomePageLink href={site.newsletterUrl} external>
        Find me on Substack
      </HomePageLink>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 relative hidden w-80 justify-self-end md:block lg:w-96"
  >
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt="Headshot of Becca Bailey"
      class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg shadow-soft"
      width={2048}
      height={3072}
      loading="eager"
    />
  </div>
</section>
